          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Harvest Load request requirements",
          "items": [
            "Field, crop, variety, acreage, and harvest lot are defined",
            "Readiness, maturity, quality, or customer basis is attached",
            "Crew, equipment, container, and label needs are stated",
            "Requested date, shift, sequence, and expected volume are stated",
            "Cooling, storage, or same-day shipping needs are identified",
            "Transport unit, route, destination, and receiver are routed",
            "Weather, access, prior hold, and capacity conflicts are described",
            "Completion evidence and load handoff are defined"
          ]
        },
